      "body": "#### Summary\n\nUpdate the fake implementation for `_moe_C::moe_wna16_marlin_gemm` to match the registered op/Python wrapper signature.\n\nThe real op and Python wrapper include optional trailing tuning arguments:\n\n- `thread_k`\n- `thread_n`\n- `blocks_per_sm`\n\nThe fake implementation did not accept those arguments, so fake/meta execution can fail with a signature mismatch even though the real op path accepts them.\n\nThis PR also mirrors the real op's output behavior: if an output tensor is provided, return it; otherwise allocate the `(size_m * top_k, size_n)` output.\n\n#### Tests\n\n- `python3 -m py_compile vllm/_custom_ops.py`\n\nI could not run broader local tests in this checkout because local test dependencies (`torch`, `pytest`) are not installed; CI should cover import/fake-op registration.\n",
